  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Transforming a field-favorite into a lightweight, no-fill bomber, our Lightweight Enhanced Nylon MA-1 Jacket is prefect for spring and fall. The military-styled bomber jacket features an enhanced nylon water-repellent outer shell with matte finish that provides protection from rain and wind.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "1314",
  "description": "<p>Transforming a field-favorite into a lightweight, no-fill bomber, our Lightweight Enhanced Nylon MA-1 Jacket is prefect for spring and fall. The military-styled bomber jacket features an enhanced nylon water-repellent outer shell with matte finish that provides protection from rain and wind. Protection from the Elements: These aviator flight jackets feature a soft ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for providing a comfortable fit and blocking out the wind while outdoors. Utility Pockets: The military pilot&rsquo;s coat comes equipped with 5 pockets: 2 front slash pockets and 2 inner welt pockets for everyday essentials, and what&rsquo;s a bomber jacket without a zippered utility sleeve pocket!? Along with exterior pen holders, this useful pocket is great for storing small items. Iconic MA-1 Styling: Inspired by the original design for fighter pilots, our rugged and dependable MA-1 Flight Bomber Jackets feature a reversible orange nylon lining that offers alternative style options. The zippered front closure with double &lsquo;MA-1&rsquo; pull tabs and storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tab pays homage to the jacket&rsquo;s heritage, functionality, and style. Take Flight: Whether you are military personnel, aviation enthusiast, or outdoor adventurer, the pilot bomber jacket is perfect as a windbreaker for spring and fall seasons while presenting a classic style that is great for casual outings and everyday use.</p>",
